.Dd November 18, 2026
.Dt NEWFS 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm newfs
.Nd construct a UFS filesystem on a block device
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl O Ar 1|2
.Op Fl b Ar block-size
.Op Fl f Ar fragment-size
.Op Fl s Ar size
.Op Fl L Ar label
.Op Ar block:0
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Formats a block device through the
.Dq block:
scheme with the pure-Rust UFS formatter.
The default is UFS2 with 4096-byte blocks and 512-byte fragments.
The
.Fl O
option selects UFS1 or UFS2.
An open or format error exits non-zero and no result is fabricated.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr gpart 1 ,
.Xr lsblk 1 ,
.Xr newfs 8
